msgstr "Tunjuk imej hingga bab semasa"

msgid ""
"Images that appear beyond your current position stay hidden, so you can't "
"spoil yourself. Granularity is per chapter: images in the chapter you are "
"currently reading are shown."
msgstr ""
"Imej yang muncul melepasi kedudukan semasa anda kekal tersembunyi, supaya "
"anda tidak terdedah kepada spoiler. Kegranularan adalah setiap bab: imej "
"dalam bab yang sedang anda baca ditunjukkan."

msgid "Show all images"
msgstr "Tunjuk semua imej"

msgid ""
"Show reference images from anywhere in the book, including parts you haven't"
" reached yet."
msgstr ""
"Tunjuk imej rujukan dari mana-mana dalam buku, termasuk bahagian yang belum "
"anda capai."

